WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:02.213
Read each policy.

3
00:00:02.213 --> 00:00:05.878
The gateway's policy,
wafp-portal: detection,

4
00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:10.562
body inspection on, rule set
2.1, bot rules and a rate limit.

5
00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:17.237
The Front Door policy: prevention, body
inspection on, rule set 2.1, no bot rules.

6
00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:21.390
Then read the plan the kit wrote: a
header that says the kit did not run it,

7
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.900
then Microsoft Learn's own switch command
for wafp-portal, with its resource

8
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.338
group and subscription, setting
prevention, the state and body inspection.

9
00:00:30.338 --> 00:00:35.450
One of three internet-facing endpoints is
behind a firewall in prevention this week.
